carnated in a story-based video game, Melody veers off the set story path, refusing to heed the call to action and instead using her powers to clean. Her new world becomes increasingly chaotic, and the story? Totally unhinged and unpredictable."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"ここは乙女ゲーム「銀の聖女と五つの誓い」の世界。転生者のメロディ・ウェーブはこの世界のヒロイン聖女になる運命であったが、彼女はゲームについて何も知らず、最強のメイドになること以外に興味がなかった。やがて、ギルドでルトルバーグ伯爵家がメイドを募集していることを知り、邸宅の一人娘であるルシアナ・ルトルバーグに仕えるようになる。メロディは最強無敵な魔法を扱えるチートキャラであるにもかかわらず、そのことを自覚しておらずスキルをメイドの仕事に全振りする。ヒロインが現れないこの世界は果たしてどうなるのか？"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kT2fq7MIk1g9wqoePaKBAngitbn.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kT2fq7MIk1g9wqoePaKBAngitbn.png","language":"en","width":1197,"height":333},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oSCW8vjOjH7ZUZza0kikD4JdaZk.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oSCW8vjOjH7ZUZza0kikD4JdaZk.png","language":"ja","width":839,"height":289}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hEczt3q4aLcacC3QJaaj2CG9VsP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hEczt3q4aLcacC3QJaaj2CG9VsP.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oZdvqCJUhaylbkVxVNbHzHDFnnY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oZdvqCJUhaylbkVxVNbHzHDFnnY.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1dOBL5Px9mHbS6GMqSom0fO48Yk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1dOBL5Px9mHbS6GMqSom0fO48Yk.jpg","language":"ja","width":1000,"height":1426},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eyUqHZrtQyNDAG2NImxvq83k5Th.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eyUqHZrtQyNDAG2NImxvq83k5Th.jpg","language":"ja","width":1879,"height":2817},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yWAToLWwrXdkqXimbQTNahZ8UkI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yWAToLWwr